## 26. 最終アーキテクチャ

```text
GitHub: dumblepy/nim-ic-sqlite
|
+-- Nim source
|
+-- C source
|    +-- ic_sqlite_vfs_shim.c
|    +-- sqlite_helpers.c
|
+-- SQLite source/header
|
+-- prebuilt
|    +-- libsqlite3_ic.a
|
+-- CI
|    +-- rebuild SQLite archive
|    +-- verify checksum
|    +-- consumer integration test
|
+-- GitHub Release
     +-- versioned prebuilt tarball
```

consumer:

```text
Nim application
     |
     | import ic_sqlite
     v
nim-ic-sqlite
     |
     +-- compile ic_sqlite_vfs_shim.c
     +-- compile sqlite_helpers.c
     +-- link libsqlite3_ic.a
     |
     v
final canister Wasm
```

